wireview-hwmon (1.5.1~26.04.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * dkms package: deregister DKMS modules on upgrade as well as removal.
    Upgrades used to leave the outgoing version registered in /var/lib/dkms
    with a dangling source symlink, which made the dkms kernel prerm hook
    fail ("Could not locate dkms.conf") whenever an old kernel was purged.
  * dkms package: postinst heals orphaned registrations left behind by
    upgrades from earlier releases before registering the new version.
  * wireviewctl flash: state unofficial, not affiliated with Thermal
    Grizzly, flash at your own risk in the confirmation prompt.

 -- Emanuele Sparvoli <sparvoli@gmail.com>  Sat, 18 Jul 2026 10:00:00 +0000

